# ===== 敏感信息（必须）=====
*key*.txt
*Key*.txt
*API*.md
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
*.crt
.env
.env.*
**/ssl/
**/*pwd*hash*
**/*密码*
**/*passwd*

# ===== 备份文件 =====
*.bak
*.bak[0-9]*
*.bak-*
*.orig
*.tmp
**/*.rootcopy.*

# ===== macOS 垃圾 =====
__MACOSX/
._*
.DS_Store

# ===== 第三方 SDK 二进制 =====
**/tmp/sdk/
*.jar
*.aar
*.pom
**/gradle-wrapper.jar

# ===== 构建/导出/临时目录 =====
**/exports/
**/uploads/
**/build/
**/node_modules/
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.kotlin/
**/.workbuddy/
**/backups/
**/src.bak/

# ===== 根级 tmp/：只忽略部署载荷与本地运行产物（dev_local.py 等开发脚本保留可提交）=====
# 注：tmp/sdk/ 由上面「第三方 SDK 二进制」规则覆盖；tmp/exports、tmp/uploads 由导出规则覆盖
/tmp/deploy_*/
/tmp/*.b64
/tmp/*.log
/tmp/local_dev.db
/tmp/*.env

# ===== 语言/IDE =====
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
**/cloud-backend/.local/
venv/
.vscode/
.idea/
.trae/
**/.gradle/
**/local.properties
wechat-miniprogram/project.private.config.json
Thumbs.db

